      "created_at": "2016-03-06T05:11:37.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was wondering what people's favorite descriptors in SotM were. &nbsp;Here are mine:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Best Villain Descriptor: Baron Blade - \"Maniacal Death-Ray Wielder\"</p><p>Best Villain Card:&nbsp;<span>La Paradoja Magnifica&nbsp;</span><span>- \"Relic, Timeship\"</span></p><p>Best Environment Card: Charging Triceratops - \"Anomaly, Dinosaur\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>With honorable mention going to Ambuscade (\"Superhuman Hunter\") for being ambiguous.</p>",
